# OpenClaw — Frontend Design System

## Stack

- **Framework**: React 19 + Vite 7
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 + shadcn/ui
- **Auth**: Clerk (`@clerk/react`) — `<ClerkProvider>` wraps the app
- **Routing**: Wouter v3
- **Data fetching**: TanStack Query v5 + Orval-generated React Query hooks
- **API communication**: `@workspace/api-client-react` (generated hooks)

## Design Tokens

```css
/* Dark mode (default) */
--background: #0a0a0f;          /* near-black base */
--card: hsl(240 10% 8%);
--border: hsl(240 5% 18%);
--primary: hsl(195 100% 50%);   /* cyan accent */
--muted-foreground: hsl(240 5% 46%);

/* Light mode (.light class on :root) */
--background: hsl(0 0% 98%);
--card: hsl(0 0% 100%);
--border: hsl(240 5% 84%);
--muted-foreground: hsl(240 5% 28%);  /* bumped from 46% for WCAG AA */
```

## Typography

- **Font**: JetBrains Mono (monospace throughout — `font-mono` on body)
- **Base size**: 14px
- **Headings**: `text-lg font-semibold` to `text-3xl font-bold`
- **Micro badges**: `text-[10px] font-mono` with colored borders

